    "type": "改错",
    "ask": "句子里有一处错误，找出来并改正。",
    "listen": "",
    "zh": "",
    "stem": "Thankfully, nobody were hurt.",
    "opts": [],
    "ans": "were → was",
    "why": "nobody 作主语，谓语用单数 was。",
    "kd": ""
   },
   {
    "type": "完成句子",
